{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 4958062,
  "courseSlug": "remix-course",
  "courseTitle": "Remix.js - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34676070",
      "title": "Adding Metadata To Routes",
      "lectureOrder": 104,
      "videoOrder": 97,
      "sourceHash": "0d263006c944d4b2f9546634b9dc478eefba326a9c13563a43f5468928b17eed",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 4.71,
          "en": "Now I'm back in this project on which we worked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.71,
          "end": 7.26,
          "en": "throughout this course, this main project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.26,
          "end": 9.27,
          "en": "But of course what you'll learn here applies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.27,
          "end": 12.18,
          "en": "to any project essentially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.18,
          "end": 15.509,
          "en": "Now in this project we got a couple of routes of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.509,
          "end": 18.12,
          "en": "and right now all these routes are missing at",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.12,
          "end": 20.91,
          "en": "least one pretty important feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.91,
          "end": 25.17,
          "en": "and that would be metadata that's attached to them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.17,
          "end": 27.15,
          "en": "Now, what is metadata?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.15,
          "end": 30.81,
          "en": "Well, it's for example, that title that should show",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.81,
          "end": 35.25,
          "en": "up in this tap bar, which is the same title that shows",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.25,
          "end": 37.65,
          "en": "up in Google search results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.65,
          "end": 40.47,
          "en": "And it's also this description which shows",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.47,
          "end": 42.78,
          "en": "up in Google search results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.78,
          "end": 45.48,
          "en": "And then there are other meta items as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.48,
          "end": 46.38,
          "en": "like for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.38,
          "end": 49.38,
          "en": "links to images that should automatically be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.38,
          "end": 52.2,
          "en": "if you share a resource on Twitter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.2,
          "end": 53.76,
          "en": "but that's a bit more advanced.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.76,
          "end": 55.14,
          "en": "But whatever it is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.14,
          "end": 58.89,
          "en": "you typically wanna include some metadata in your pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.89,
          "end": 62.52,
          "en": "And right now our application, if we start that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.52,
          "end": 65.91,
          "en": "development server doesn't really have any metadata.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.91,
          "end": 68.67,
          "en": "It doesn't even show a title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 68.67,
          "end": 70.47,
          "en": "And that's what we'll fix now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 70.47,
          "end": 72.45,
          "en": "Now metadata is added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.45,
          "end": 76.68,
          "en": "with a special meta function that can be exported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.68,
          "end": 78.12,
          "en": "in your route files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.12,
          "end": 81.51,
          "en": "And indeed the root route is exporting such a meta",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 81.51,
          "end": 85.59,
          "en": "function already just using the arrow function syntax here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.59,
          "end": 88.35,
          "en": "However, this title here is currently not showing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 88.35,
          "end": 90.402,
          "en": "up in my tab here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 90.402,
          "end": 94.65,
          "en": "The reason for that is that I set my own document here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.65,
          "end": 97.25999999999999,
          "en": "I created my own document component, which I use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.25999999999999,
          "end": 99.9,
          "en": "in my app here and in my error pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.9,
          "end": 101.97,
          "en": "And there I set a title manually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 101.97,
          "end": 104.94,
          "en": "in the head section, which is generally fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 104.94,
          "end": 108.60300000000001,
          "en": "You can add any elements you want to head and body here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.56,
          "end": 112.95,
          "en": "However, when you rely on this meta function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.95,
          "end": 115.95,
          "en": "which we do in our non error pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.95,
          "end": 119.4,
          "en": "then Remix will merge the metadata you define",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 119.4,
          "end": 122.97,
          "en": "in these functions with all the other metadata set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.97,
          "end": 126.66,
          "en": "by any other routes automatically and injected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.66,
          "end": 130.533,
          "en": "into the head section into this meta element here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.43,
          "end": 133.65,
          "en": "However, if you also set your own title here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.65,
          "end": 136.14,
          "en": "that overrides any title you might set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.14,
          "end": 139.53,
          "en": "in your other metadata that gets injected here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.53,
          "end": 143.04,
          "en": "And therefore we should set this title conditionally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 143.04,
          "end": 145.02,
          "en": "only if the title props defined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 145.02,
          "end": 147.9,
          "en": "Do I want to set the title like this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 147.9,
          "end": 151.5,
          "en": "And with this change made, we get this default title back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 151.5,
          "end": 153.63,
          "en": "for all our pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 153.63,
          "end": 156.48,
          "en": "And that's another important lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 156.48,
          "end": 160.2,
          "en": "The metadata you set here in the root route is applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 160.2,
          "end": 164.4,
          "en": "to all other routes, so to all child routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 164.4,
          "end": 167.85,
          "en": "And that's true in general for this meta function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 167.85,
          "end": 170.394,
          "en": "If you define this meta function in one of your routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 170.394,
          "end": 173.64,
          "en": "it also gets applied to all child routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 173.64,
          "end": 176.55,
          "en": "And since the root route wraps all other routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 176.55,
          "end": 178.59,
          "en": "and includes all other routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 178.59,
          "end": 181.62,
          "en": "this metadata gets applied to all routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 181.62,
          "end": 185.1,
          "en": "So here we can set up some general metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 185.1,
          "end": 187.71,
          "en": "or fallback metadata.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 187.71,
          "end": 189.99,
          "en": "But we can override this metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 189.99,
          "end": 194.1,
          "en": "with more specific metadata defined in our child routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 194.1,
          "end": 197.13,
          "en": "because metadata defined in child routes wins",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 197.13,
          "end": 201.122,
          "en": "over the current metadata if there are any clashes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 201.122,
          "end": 206.122,
          "en": "For example, if I go to my marketing index jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.34,
          "end": 208.81,
          "en": "and I export this meta function there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 209.7,
          "end": 211.35,
          "en": "I can also return an object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 211.35,
          "end": 213.48,
          "en": "and set a more specific title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 213.48,
          "end": 215.94299999999998,
          "en": "like remakes expenses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 216.986,
          "end": 219.3,
          "en": "the complete app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 219.3,
          "end": 220.92000000000002,
          "en": "whatever.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 220.92000000000002,
          "end": 221.753,
          "en": "And you will see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 221.753,
          "end": 224.76,
          "en": "that now this more specific title wins here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 224.76,
          "end": 227.11,
          "en": "If I hover over it, you can see the full title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 228.42000000000002,
          "end": 231.78,
          "en": "We can of course also set up page specific description here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 231.78,
          "end": 233.61,
          "en": "by adding this description key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 233.61,
          "end": 237.84,
          "en": "where I could say manage your expenses with these.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 237.84,
          "end": 239.34,
          "en": "And you can add metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 239.34,
          "end": 242.46,
          "en": "like this to all your routes, like for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 242.46,
          "end": 246.51,
          "en": "also to the pricing route where we could say pricing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 246.51,
          "end": 249.99,
          "en": "and then say, see our pricing plans.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 249.99,
          "end": 251.67,
          "en": "Now I'm not going to repeat this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 251.67,
          "end": 254.91,
          "en": "for all the routes since it's just the repetitive task",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 254.91,
          "end": 257.103,
          "en": "but this is how you can add metadata.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 258.091,
          "end": 260.79,
          "en": "Now adding metadata gets more interesting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 260.79,
          "end": 265.131,
          "en": "if the data or the information you wanna output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 265.131,
          "end": 268.14,
          "en": "with help of metadata is dynamic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 268.14,
          "end": 271.14,
          "en": "Like for example on this ID route here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 271.14,
          "end": 273.09000000000003,
          "en": "dollar sign ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 273.09000000000003,
          "end": 277.05,
          "en": "There, we also might want to output some metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 277.05,
          "end": 279.63,
          "en": "but maybe the title which we wanna output here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 279.63,
          "end": 282.21,
          "en": "should be dynamic and should be the title of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 282.21,
          "end": 285.303,
          "en": "the expense that we selected here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 286.44,
          "end": 288.48,
          "en": "Now to help us with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 288.48,
          "end": 291.93,
          "en": "this meta function actually receives an object with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 291.93,
          "end": 294.13,
          "en": "a couple of pieces information inside of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 295.23,
          "end": 297.24,
          "en": "To be precise, it gets an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 297.24,
          "end": 300.54,
          "en": "which has params key inside of it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 300.54,
          "end": 303.36,
          "en": "which holds an object with any dynamic params",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 303.36,
          "end": 304.89,
          "en": "we might have in this route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 304.89,
          "end": 308.79,
          "en": "In this case, it would be an object with the ID value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 308.79,
          "end": 310.713,
          "en": "Since we're on the ID route here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 311.67,
          "end": 313.26,
          "en": "We get a location object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 313.26,
          "end": 315.66,
          "en": "which basically gives us access to the information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 315.66,
          "end": 318.12,
          "en": "You also find on window dot location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 318.12,
          "end": 321.45,
          "en": "If you console lock that in a browser, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 321.45,
          "end": 325.74,
          "en": "you can get access to the URL by accessing the ref prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 325.74,
          "end": 328.26,
          "en": "And that would for example, then allow you to also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 328.26,
          "end": 331.548,
          "en": "get access to the search parents if you needed that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 331.548,
          "end": 335.15999999999997,
          "en": "And you also get access to the loader data returned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 335.15999999999997,
          "end": 337.32,
          "en": "by the loader of this route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 337.32,
          "end": 339.9,
          "en": "In this case, however, we have no loader, we only",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 339.9,
          "end": 342.57,
          "en": "have an action and we're not using the loader anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 342.57,
          "end": 345.761,
          "en": "because here for this dollar sign ID route, we actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 345.761,
          "end": 350.761,
          "en": "use the loader data of a parent loader by using useMatches.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 350.79,
          "end": 353.04,
          "en": "You learned about that earlier in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 353.97,
          "end": 356.73,
          "en": "But you can also access parent loader data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 356.73,
          "end": 359.34000000000003,
          "en": "with help of this meta function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 359.34000000000003,
          "end": 361.83,
          "en": "Because besides the parents",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 361.83,
          "end": 365.43,
          "en": "and location and data, you also get the parents data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 365.43,
          "end": 368.07,
          "en": "And that is simply an object containing all the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 368.07,
          "end": 369.633,
          "en": "by all parent routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 370.65,
          "end": 374.94,
          "en": "Now you can console log it to understand its shape,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 374.94,
          "end": 376.21,
          "en": "and if I do that here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 377.19,
          "end": 380.61,
          "en": "and I then go to my expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 380.61,
          "end": 384.69,
          "en": "and load a detailed expense and I then reload this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 384.69,
          "end": 388.11,
          "en": "you see that I get some log output here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 388.11,
          "end": 389.79,
          "en": "and that is my parents' data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 389.79,
          "end": 390.96,
          "en": "And you see that in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 390.96,
          "end": 393.931,
          "en": "this is an object where the keys are the IDs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 393.931,
          "end": 396.81,
          "en": "that we also had in this matches array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 396.81,
          "end": 399.03,
